---

The Z-Image model code in src/zimage/ is ported from the z_image module of
candle-transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/candle), Copyright (c) the
candle authors, used under the MIT License above.

The Qwen-Image-2.1 code in src/qwen21/ is a Rust port (translated from Python
to Rust, restructured for MLX and single-image inference) of:

- diffusers (https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers): QwenImage21Pipeline,
  QwenImage21Transformer2DModel, AutoencoderKLQwenImage21 and
  FlowMatchEulerDiscreteScheduler, Copyright 2026 Qwen-Image Team and
  The HuggingFace Team;
- transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers): Qwen3-VL
  (text and vision models) and the Qwen2-VL image processor, Copyright
  The HuggingFace Team;

both licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, included in LICENSE-APACHE.
scripts/make_qwen21_reference.py uses those libraries.
